        "quote": "Prior to any use or development within the planned unit development district, the district shall be established in accordance with the provisions of this division, including the approval of all plans set forth in the procedure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.190.050 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "b2be4a9f-3d8f-532a-bb69-29b5473a05fb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 962,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.050:block:1",
          "start": 228
        },
        "quote": "(a) Application to Amend to the District. Except as set forth by this division, a petition to reclassify property to the planned unit development district shall be as established in Chapter 18.245 TMC, Amendments, and include like contents. Additionally, the application shall include the specified number of copies of the planned unit development master plan which shall consist of the following documents, information and graphics unless determined to be unnecessary by the Planning Director. The Planning Director may waive the submittal of the master plan in circumstances where the conditions of approval, restrictions, and limitations of the planned unit development can be addressed in the ordinance reclassifying the property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.190.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "2ef4237f-eec6-5ae3-8531-35859d2d412a",
