          "end": 1088,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.050:block:2",
          "start": 963
        },
        "quote": "(1) Legal description of the proposed district in its entirety, total acreage, and planned unit development name/designation.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.190.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
